      "message": "do we have max_clamp for all background tasks? on older kernel with prefer_idle, this can link to prefer_idle which mapped to foreground/top_app tasks. The power efficiency probably not a top priority for upstream but for embedded system, it should be.\nthat\u0027s why we disabled this boost on Pixel phones but I am considering do it for foreground/TA for benefit of UX.",
